# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. tool_intent
#
# NOTE: this contract type carries NO execution-authority field of any
# kind. Authority/admission semantics belong exclusively to the concurrent
# session's beam4pm-post-llm-runtime-pack (rt: vocabulary). This record is
# inert descriptive data about a proposed call, nothing more.
